Subject: [PATCH 19/19] feat(notes): resume imports and filter PDF navigation
 pages

Persist incomplete notes-import checkpoints and skip completed leading chunks on identical retries.
Filter table-of-contents and index PDF pages before extraction.
Validate fetch DNS candidates and literals on Windows; make test fixtures portable without weakening supported security assertions.
